{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22403","headline":"寄杨六 · 白居易","name":"寄杨六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青宫官冷静，赤县事繁剧。\n一闲复一忙，动作经时隔。\n清觞久废酌，白日顿虚掷。\n念此忽踟蹰，悄然心不适。\n岂无旧交结，久别或迁易。\n亦有新往还，相见多形迹。\n唯君於我分，坚久如金石。\n何况老大来，人情重姻戚。\n会稀岁月急，此事真可惜。\n几回开口笑，便到髭须白。\n公门苦鞅掌，尽日无闲隙。\n犹冀乘暝来，静言同一夕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}